# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestResolveHeadWithoutReclaim
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: resolving a deferred close records the staleHigh head without re-claiming the generation, so the stale donor is admitted above it
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ pend' = FALSE
    /\ gL' = Max2(gL, pendGen)
--- REPLACE
    /\ pend' = FALSE
\* MUTATION: no re-claim; stale admissions continue.
    /\ gL' = gL
--- END
